      "unicodePath",
      unicodeKept === "1" ? "pass" : "fail",
      unicodeKept === "1" ? "localStorage is kept in a profile folder with non-English letters." : `localStorage was lost in a profile folder with non-English letters (${join3(root, UNICODE_FOLDER)}). Profiles would lose site data if the path of the data folder (the Windows user name) had such letters.`
